  "question": {
    "text": "A metallic element crystallizes into a lattice containing a sequence layers of ABABAB ..... . Any packing of spheres leaves out voids in the lattice. What percentage by volume of this lattice is empty space?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "26",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Packing fraction in hcp <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Area (of base) of unit cell in hcp <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> (follow text)<br /><br />height of unit cell in hcp <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> (follow text)<br /><br />So packing fraction <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.74</mn></math><br /><br />or = 74%<br /><br />Thus, empty space in hcp = 1 - 0.74 = 0.26<br /><br />or = 26%."
  }
